#! ia 1.0

@playbook note-review
  meaning
    says "Review one of the demo workspace's notes and report what the review finds."
    answers "How is a note in the demo workspace reviewed?"
  cognition
    orient
      primary Memory
      Attention means "Notice which records the note cites."
      Memory means "Recall the findings already reported on the note."
    plan
      primary Inference
      Inference means "Infer which of the note's claims its cited records can confirm."
      Decision means "Decide which claims to check first."
    act
      primary Decision
      Decision means "Report each finding with the record and field behind it."
      Escalation means "Name the demo participant before reporting a blocking finding." when severity is blocking
    learn
      primary Learning
      Learning means "Record what the review did not check."
